t("Take me! Take me!", "¡Llévame! ¡Llévame!", "_t")
t("From death comes life!", "¡De la muerte viene la vida!", "_t")
t("corrupted monolith", "monolito corrupto", "_t")
t("This is too soon!", "¡Esto es demasiado pronto!", "_t")
