t("red stylish hat", "sombrero de estilo rojo", "_t")
t("Needs something equally stylish and cool to go with it.", "Necesita algo igualmente elegante y fresco para ir con él.", "_t")
t("#STEEL_BLUE#A time vortex briefly appears in front of you.", "#STEEL BLUE#A time vortex briefly appears in front of you.", "logPlayer")
t("Crude Iron Battle Axe of Kroll", "Batalla de hierro cruzado Axe de Kroll", "entity name")
