section "mod-tome/data/chats/slasul.lua"


-- new text
--[==[
t("[attack]", "[ataque]", "_t")
t("So be it... Die now!", "Así que sea... ¡Muere ahora!", "_t")
t("I was sent by Ukllmswwik to stop your mad schemes to control all underwater life!", "¡Me envió Ukllmswwik para detener tus planes locos para controlar toda la vida submarina!", "_t")
t("Your feeble attempt to sway me from the side of good will not work. Pay for you sins!", "Tu débil intento de alejarme del lado del bien no funcionará. ¡Paga por tus pecados!", "_t")
t("If you refuse to see reason, you leave me no choice!", "¡Si te niegas a ver la razón, no me dejas elección!", "_t")
t("Your words are... disturbing. Why should I spare you?", "Tus palabras son... perturbadoras. ¿Por qué debería perdonarte?", "_t")
t("You do not sound mad to me... could Ukllmswwik have lied?", "No me suenas loco... ¿Podría Ukllmswwik haber mentido?", "_t")
t("I will not be deceived by your lies! I will make your pay for your victims!", "¡No seré engañado por tus mentiras! ¡Haré tu pago por tus víctimas!", "_t")
t("As you wish. It did not have to come to this...", "Como quieras. No tenía que venir a esto...", "_t")
t("Use this portal. It will bring you back to his cave; ask him the truth.", "Usa este portal. Te traerá de vuelta a su cueva; pregúntale la verdad.", "_t")
t("I will make him pay for his treachery.", "Le haré pagar por su traición.", "_t")
t("Thank you for listening to me.", "Gracias por escucharme.", "_t")
t("The dragon was lying, I can feel it. I have decided to embrace your cause.", "El dragón estaba mintiendo, puedo sentirlo. He decidido aceptar tu causa.", "_t")
t("Farewell, Slasul.", "Adiós Slasul.", "_t")
t("I shall accept your offer, my liege.", "Aceptaré tu oferta, mi mentira.", "_t")
t("LET US BE BOUND!", "¡VAMOS A ESTAR CERCA!", "_t")
t("This sounds strange. I need to think about it.", "Esto suena extraño. Necesito pensarlo.", "_t")
--]==]

